{"availability":"available","full":"woodlandChess/woodlandChess.github.io","name":"woodlandChess.github.io","description":"A mobile-first, browser-native chess app built with React and TypeScript, featuring a Stockfish 18 WASM engine, ten opening-book playing schools, and a handcrafted dark design system.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-11T07:41:29Z","updated":"2026-10-15T05:52:08Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://woodlandchess.github.io/","topics":["alpha-beta-pruning","chess","chess-engine","chess-game","chessjs","dark-theme","design-system","github-pages","minimax","mobile-first","progressive-web-app","pwa","react","stockfish","typescript","vite","vitest","wasm","web-worker","webassembly"],"demo":"https://woodlandchess.github.io/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T21:35:30.654Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T21:35:30.654Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T21:35:30.654Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T05:44:29.651Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-15T19:30:29.107Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T21:35:30.654Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A chess game forged in React and TypeScript, powered by Stockfish 18, designed for intent.","Woodland Chess is a mobile-first, browser-native chess application with a handcrafted dark design system. It plays entirely client-side, with no server, no account, and no tracking; Stockfish 18 Lite runs as a Web Worker via WebAssembly. Ten historical playing schools shape the engine's opening repertoire, and three difficulty tiers adjust its Skill Level and search time.","The visual design inherits from the Abyssal Liturgy aesthetic: near-black surfaces, muted grey tokens, Cormorant Garamond italics for display text, and Jost for interface copy. Every spacing value, colour token, and easing curve is defined as a CSS custom property so the system can be extended without touching component markup."],"features":["♔ Full legal-move enforcement via chess.js (FEN, SAN, PGN)","♞ Pawn promotion modal with piece picker","♗ Check, checkmate, stalemate, draw detection","♜ Move history displayed as paired SAN notation","♛ Play as White or Black; board does not flip"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/woodlandChess/woodlandChess.github.io/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"17f0f9b46187fb3df77615cf629e693aeeabee6501c7ec1f23caa653752697b1","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:29.811Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T21:35:30.766Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A chess game forged in React and TypeScript, powered by Stockfish 18, designed for intent.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/woodlandChess/woodlandChess.github.io/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"A chess game forged in React and TypeScript, powered by Stockfish 18, designed for intent.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/woodlandChess/woodlandChess.github.io/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"It plays entirely client-side, with no server, no account, and no tracking; Stockfish 18 Lite runs as a Web Worker via WebAssembly.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/woodlandChess/woodlandChess.github.io/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"17f0f9b46187fb3df77615cf629e693aeeabee6501c7ec1f23caa653752697b1","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/woodlandChess/woodlandChess.github.io/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T21:35:30.766Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-15T05:52:08Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/woodlandChess/woodlandChess.github.io/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T21:35:30.767Z","hash":"17f0f9b46187fb3df77615cf629e693aeeabee6501c7ec1f23caa653752697b1","originalBytes":16115,"storedBytes":16115,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T21:35:30.654Z","subjects":["Games & game development","Mobile","Templates & UI components","Browser extensions & PWAs"],"